Subject: Re: Define higher order factor model
Message-ID: <_U8VpuY4fC4.tSh0wJ_wAwAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <_U8VpuY4fC4.UWBsNb1NAQAJ@lavaan.groups.google.com>
