Okay! I already found the solution!

quiet <- function(fit) {
  sink(tempfile())
  on.exit(sink())
  invisible(summary(fit, standardized = TRUE, fit.measures=TRUE))
}
sum <- quiet(fit)

Thank you anyway, I hope this could help someone in the future!

Alicia.

